# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Environment / secrets — NEVER commit real credentials.
# Only sanitized examples (env.example, .env.example) belong in Git.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# T00: the Tow test template is a tracked, secret-free example. Without this
# negation it matches `**/.env.*` and is in Git only because it was force-added.
# The scope is intentionally one exact path: real `.env` files, `.env.test`,
# `.env.local`, `.env.production` and `.env.bak` stay ignored.
!socorre_ai_backend/.env.test.example
# MVP-01 EXT: Tow documents are private; their default storage tree must never be
# committed or served statically.
socorre_ai_backend/private/
*.pem
*.key
